00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:05.460
which is our big thing, right?

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:06.690
Eight hydrogens.

00:14:07.409 --> 00:14:10.500
And then we have our six electrons.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:10.930
Okay.

